  "bg-shape-motion-laser-scanline": "/* ==========================================================================\n   CSS BACKGROUND SHAPE: #254 — Tactical CRT Laser Scanline\n   --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Class Name  : .bg-shape-motion-laser-scanline\n   Category    : Cinematic Motion & Animations\n   Description : Architectural blueprint pinstripes with a high-precision laser beam scanning vertically across section content.\n   Best For    : Identity verification, security audits, financial technology, terminal dashboards & forensics\n   \n   HOW TO USE IN WORDPRESS / ELEMENTOR:\n   1. Ensure the IN-GENERAL BASE CSS is added once to your site.\n      (Paste in Customizer > Additional CSS, Elementor Custom CSS, or style.css)\n   2. Paste this Shape CSS into your child theme style.css or Additional CSS.\n   3. In Elementor: Select Section/Container > Advanced > CSS Classes -> add: bg-shape-motion-laser-scanline\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.bg-shape-motion-laser-scanline::before {\n  inset: 0;\n  background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(rgba(var(--bg-shape-color), 0.16) 0 1px, transparent 1px 4rem);\n}\n.bg-shape-motion-laser-scanline::after {\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  top: -100px;\n  height: 90px;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(var(--bg-shape-color), 0.28) 95%, rgba(var(--bg-shape-color), 0.60) 100%);\n  animation: motionScanlineSweep 6s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) infinite;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(var(--bg-shape-color), 0.25);\n  will-change: top;\n}\n@keyframes motionScanlineSweep {\n  0% { top: -100px; opacity: 0; }\n  10% { opacity: 1; }\n  90% { opacity: 1; }\n  100% { top: 110%; opacity: 0; }\n}",
