  "bg-shape-motion-speed-streams": "/* ==========================================================================\n   CSS BACKGROUND SHAPE: #260 — High-Velocity Kinetic Speed Streams\n   --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Class Name  : .bg-shape-motion-speed-streams\n   Category    : Cinematic Motion & Animations\n   Description : Dynamic 45-degree light streaks and velocity lines streaming continuously across the canvas with exhilarating pace.\n   Best For    : Sports brands, logistics speed, high-frequency trading, automotive & gaming tournaments\n   \n   HOW TO USE IN WORDPRESS / ELEMENTOR:\n   1. Ensure the IN-GENERAL BASE CSS is added once to your site.\n      (Paste in Customizer > Additional CSS, Elementor Custom CSS, or style.css)\n   2. Paste this Shape CSS into your child theme style.css or Additional CSS.\n   3. In Elementor: Select Section/Container > Advanced > CSS Classes -> add: bg-shape-motion-speed-streams\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.bg-shape-motion-speed-streams::before {\n  inset: -50%;\n  background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n    -45deg,\n    transparent 0 45px,\n    rgba(var(--bg-shape-color), 0.20) 45px 46px,\n    transparent 46px 90px\n  );\n  animation: motionSpeedStream 12s linear infinite;\n  mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #000 30%, transparent 75%);\n  -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #000 30%, transparent 75%);\n}\n@keyframes motionSpeedStream {\n  0% { transform: translate(0, 0); }\n  100% { transform: translate(120px, 120px); }\n}",
